1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:01,780
What if the Moon disappeared tonight?

2
00:00:02,090 --> 00:00:05,640
The oceans, nights, and even life
on Earth would change forever.

3
00:00:05,850 --> 00:00:08,990
Most people think the Moon is just a
beautiful object lighting up our night

4
00:00:08,990 --> 00:00:09,500
sky.

5
00:00:09,660 --> 00:00:11,430
But it's doing something
much more important.

6
00:00:11,550 --> 00:00:13,920
It's constantly influencing
our planet through gravity.

7
00:00:14,150 --> 00:00:16,820
The Moon is the main reason
we experience ocean tides.

8
00:00:17,210 --> 00:00:18,580
If it suddenly disappeared,

9
00:00:18,690 --> 00:00:21,880
tides wouldn't stop completely
because the Sun also creates tides.

10
00:00:22,190 --> 00:00:25,200
But the tidal range would become
much smaller in many places.

11
00:00:25,410 --> 00:00:26,480
And there's another problem.

12
00:00:26,710 --> 00:00:29,260
The Moon helps stabilize
Earth's axial tilt.

13
00:00:29,520 --> 00:00:30,220
Without it,

14
00:00:30,220 --> 00:00:34,550
Earth's tilt could experience much larger
changes over geological timescales.

15
00:00:34,820 --> 00:00:38,170
That could lead to major changes in
our climate over millions of years.

16
00:00:38,350 --> 00:00:39,880
Life wouldn't disappear overnight.

17
00:00:40,040 --> 00:00:43,230
Earth would still orbit the Sun,
and we'd still have days and nights.

18
00:00:43,420 --> 00:00:45,730
But our planet would be
a very different place.

19
00:00:45,930 --> 00:00:50,040
Have you ever imagined how empty the
night sky would look without the Moon?

